# Trivy misconfig suppressions for Synesis
#
# KSV-0014: readOnlyRootFilesystem
# Requires emptyDir mounts per container for /tmp, model caches, HF_HOME, etc.
# Too invasive to enable safely across all services without per-service testing.
# First-party images already run as non-root with dropped capabilities.
KSV-0014

# KSV-0118: Default security context (no securityContext configured)
# Suppressed for third-party images where we don't control runtime behavior:
#   - litellm (ghcr.io/berriai/litellm)
#   - vLLM (registry.redhat.io/rhaiis/vllm-cuda-rhel9, quay.io vllm-cpu)
#   - KServe ServingRuntime templates
# First-party deployments (planner, supervisor, mcp, bge-reranker, indexers)
# have securityContext configured directly in their manifests.
KSV-0118
